    "detailed_description": "\u300eDodge \u00d7 Beat\u300f<br><br>Sympathia is a rhythm game in which the player presses the notes while avoiding flying bullets.<br>The main characters are &quot;Tomoha Sasanaki (Sana)&quot; a girl with a miraculous ability, and &quot;Turk&quot; a high-performance robot.<br>Sana and Turk can synchronize with other people's hearts through their miraculous ability &quot;Sympathia&quot;.<br>In order to wake up everyone whom the genius doctor &quot;Hakuho Kurasagi&quot; put to sleep, try to synchronize with the beating of their hearts while avoiding the defensive reactions of their hearts.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Beat to the rhythm!* Tap the beat on the move and create your own unique rhythm!* Enjoy the story that unfolds in the doctor's house!* Easy (Mild) and Difficult (Severe) modes are available.</ul><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619210/extras/1506f4a857e6613e35d8a435fac8991a.poster.avif?t=1705330842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619210/extras/1506f4a857e6613e35d8a435fac8991a.apng?t=1705330842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span>",
